// title: Phishing by Design Two Step Attacks Using vsdx Files
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceNetworkEvents, EmailAttachmentInfo, EmailEvents, EmailUrlInfo
// purpose: Phishing by Design Two Step Attacks Using vsdx Files
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/Phishing%20by%20Design%20Two-Step%20Attacks%20Using%20vsdx%20Files.kql
